#
#  Stock WPS Vtable.GFS with every below-ground row (level type 112: the
#  ST*/SM* layer soil) REMOVED. Used when a run's soil comes from a RUC
#  9-level analysis staged as a metgrid constants file instead of from GFS:
#  with GFS soil ungribbed alongside that constants file, met_em
#  would carry BOTH num_st_layers and num_soilt_levels and real.exe's soil
#  choice becomes ambiguous (see SOIL_DIMS in image/runner.py). Stripping
#  the GFS rows makes the RUC levels the only soil in the run.
#
#  Atmosphere/surface rows are byte-identical to the WPS 4.6 Vtable.GFS —
#  SKINTEMP, LANDSEA, SNOW, SOILHGT deliberately stay GFS-sourced (the
#  constants file carries ONLY SOILT*/SOILM*, so there is no
#  time-independent-vs-time-dependent field collision in metgrid).
#
